{"page":343,"width":1740,"height":2659,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"9.3 페이징 403","words":[{"text":"9.3","x":1257,"y":154,"width":56,"height":23},{"text":"페이징","x":1329,"y":154,"width":70,"height":27},{"text":"403","x":1472,"y":149,"width":59,"height":28}]},{"text":"페이지 테이블의 하드웨어 구현은 여러 가지 방법으로 수행할 수 있다. 가장 간단한","words":[{"text":"페이지","x":329,"y":283,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"테이블의","x":443,"y":283,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"하드웨어","x":585,"y":282,"width":120,"height":37},{"text":"구현은","x":721,"y":283,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"여러","x":827,"y":283,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"가지","x":901,"y":283,"width":56,"height":37},{"text":"방법으로","x":976,"y":282,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"수행할","x":1112,"y":282,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1221,"y":282,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1269,"y":282,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"가장","x":1356,"y":281,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"간단한","x":1434,"y":281,"width":100,"height":36}]},{"text":"경우, 페이지 테이블은 전용 고속 하드웨어 레지스터 세트로 구현되므로 페이지 주소 변","words":[{"text":"경우,","x":266,"y":341,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"페이지","x":356,"y":343,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"테이블은","x":469,"y":344,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"전용","x":610,"y":342,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"고속","x":684,"y":344,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"하드웨어","x":758,"y":343,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"레지스터","x":894,"y":343,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"세트로","x":1029,"y":344,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"구현되므로","x":1136,"y":343,"width":162,"height":36},{"text":"페이지","x":1312,"y":342,"width":92,"height":37},{"text":"주소","x":1421,"y":343,"width":66,"height":35},{"text":"변","x":1502,"y":343,"width":30,"height":34}]},{"text":"환이 매우 효율적이다. 그러나 이러한 접근 방식은 각각의 레지스터가 문맥 교환 중에","words":[{"text":"환이","x":264,"y":401,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"매우","x":349,"y":403,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"효율적이다.","x":431,"y":404,"width":168,"height":36},{"text":"그러나","x":618,"y":403,"width":93,"height":37},{"text"